message.content:
The plan changes some existing behavior, so the matching existing test files are rewritten:

- the Home hero's second button,
- the six-link header and footer navigation,
- the empty contact form now including `companySize`,
- the sixth custom-development item,
- the seven prerendered and sitemap pages.

One existing check now contradicts the task: the old Services test required each section's text to end with "Typical engagement". The task moves that line into the section header, before the items, so the updated test only checks that the line is present.

The new files cover:

- the new content modules,
- the architecture diagram,
- the redesigned Home page,
- the Systems and Engagements pages,
- photos on every page,
- the other redesigned pages and the header and footer,
- the design tokens and styles.

